Data Consumers

## Slide 3

Content Parts | Simple Consumers

Do NOT have a configured Source Values Key property for receiving a DataTable
Individual values are mapped to Part properties using the Values Key settings or Content Expressions
Examples include…
Headers
Details
Single Tiles

Filters
Data Providers
Data Consumers

