## Slide 5

Content Parts: Complex Consumers

## Slide 6

Content Parts | Complex Consumers

Parts that expect one or more DataTable sources as inputs to be Rendered
The Source Values Key property specifies the Values Key for the expected DataTable
Provider Parts must be configured with a matching Source Values Key
Consumer Parts must have a higher Initialization Order than Provider Parts

